# JOURNEY · a snail never swims: bought in the shop, it settles on the glass and crawls the frame.
# A new game starts with Adam, Lilith and Eva, so the snail's shell (@) is the one in the tank.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/buy-a-fish.play Caracol Shelly
tick 60
expect @
snap the snail holds on to the glass
run /index
expect Shelly
snap the snail is in the index
key esc
absent Shelly
